  Summon_121426_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonRed:Bloodline Stream>] Realm Anchor Event Awakening, the base probability for obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, with an overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. SSR items are Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR item after maximum 30 Awakenings.\nWhen obtaining an SSR through Awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be an Awakener.\nIf two consecutive SSRs obtained through Awakening are Wheels of Destiny, the next SSR will be guaranteed to be an Awakener.\n\nIf two consecutive SSRs obtained through Awakening are Awakeners, the next SSR will be guaranteed to be a Wheel of Destiny.\nCurrent status: {s2} consecutive SSR Awakeners obtained. {s3} {s1}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn this Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.02%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.\nGuaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:\n96.97% chance for SR item\n3.03% chance for SSR item\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\nAdditional rewards per Awakening:\nSR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments\nR Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment\nDuplicate SSR Awakener conversion:\n2nd-16th copies: 1 Gnosis Fragment + 50 Radix Sediments\n17th+ copies:\nStandard Awakeners: 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment + 3 Gnosis Fragments + 150 Radix Sediments;\nLimited Awakeners: 2 Refined Gnosis Fragment + 6 Gnosis Fragments + 250 Radix Sediments\nNote: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).\n\nThis Awakening belongs to [Realm Anchor Awakening]:\nPity count carries over between all [[Realm Anchor Awakening], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
