  Summon_122597_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] The limited-time Character Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time featured character <SummonBlue:Genesis Lotan>.
: During the event, the probability of Awakening the limited SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Genesis Lotan> will be increased.
: In this limited-time Character Event Awakening, aside from special rules such as rate-up and guaranteed Awakens, all Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny use the base rates. Please refer to the rules for details.
: Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time Character Event Awakening, Keepers can Awaken once per day at a discounted cost of 60 Silver Prime and receive an additional 60 Silver.

<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>
: Due to the unique nature of gameplay, balance adjustments may be made to strengthen or weaken the Effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny to ensure fairness and enjoyment.
: When a weakening occurs, a limited-time rollback feature will be enabled to give Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny the opportunity to reallocate development or Awakening resources.
: Please make sure you understand and accept this before investing resources]]
  },
  Summon_122597_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener via the guaranteed system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Genesis Lotan>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awaken attempts is not the featured rate-up character of this period, the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the featured rate-up character. {s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non-featured rate-up character {s2} times in a row. {s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny items.\n·Within a maximum of 5 Awaken attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item. When obtaining an item through the guaranteed system, the Probability of receiving an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of receiving an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by-product.\n·Regardless of the method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd to 16th time, each duplicate will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment. Starting from the 17th time and onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment; limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selective methods (including Sepirot Paradise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awakening count is accumulated jointly and is counted independently from the guaranteed counts of other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
