    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nAt the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guarantee) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny through the guarantee within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Wheel of Destiny for this period, <SummonOrange:Genesis Lotan Exclusive Weapon>.\n·If the last obtained SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken was not the featured Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken is guaranteed to be the featured Wheel of Destiny for this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nAt the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guarantee) is 25.00%. All SR items obtainable in this Awaken are Wheel of Destiny.\n·A maximum of 5 Awaken attempts guarantees an SR or higher item. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·This Awaken belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awaken count is accumulated together and is independently counted from other Awaken types.\n"
