limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments + 6 Gnosis Fragments + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).

This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]:
Pity count carries over between all [Character Event Awakening], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
