    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the total Probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny through the pity system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be this period’s rate‑up SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Tsathoggua Exclusive Weapon>.\n·If the last SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken was not the rate‑up Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken is guaranteed to be the rate‑up Wheel of Destiny for this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] Wheel of Destiny Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, and the total Probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items obtainable in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·Within a maximum of 5 Awaken attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item through pity. When obtaining an SR item through pity, the Probability is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awaken, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a by‑product; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment.\n·This Awakening belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], pity Awaken counts accumulate together and are counted independently from other Awakening types.\n"
  },
