  Summon_130361_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] The limited-time Character Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time featured character <SummonBlue:Tsathoggua>.
: During the event, the Awakening rate of the limited SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tsathoggua> will be increased.
: In this limited-time Character Event Awakening, except for rate-up, guaranteed rewards, and other special rules, all Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny use the base rates. Please refer to the rules for details.
: Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time Character Event Awakening, Keepers can Awaken once per day at a discounted cost of 60 Silver Prime and receive an additional 60 Silver.

<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>
: Due to the unique gameplay, balance adjustments may be made to weaken or strengthen the Effects of Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny to ensure fairness and enjoyment.
: When a weakening occurs, a limited-time rollback feature will be enabled to offer the opportunity to redeploy resources used for developing or Awakening Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny.
: Please make sure you understand and accept this before investing resources]]
  },
  Summon_130361_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the total Probability (including guarantee) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the pity system within at most 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be this period’s rate-up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tsathoggua>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awakens is not the rate-up character of this period, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the rate-up character of this period.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non–rate-up character {s2} times in a row.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, and the total Probability (including guarantee) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item within at most 5 Awaken attempts; when obtaining an item through the pity system, the Probability of receiving an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of receiving an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as byproducts; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd–16th time, each duplicate will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment; from the 17th time onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selection-based methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], pity count will accumulate together and is counted independently from other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
