  Summon_130362_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guarantee within up to 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be this period’s rate-up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Nordens>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awaken attempts is not the rate-up character for this period, the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be this period’s rate-up character.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non–rate-up character for {s2} consecutive times.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item within up to 5 Awaken attempts. When obtaining an item through the guarantee, the Probability of receiving an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of receiving an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method used (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), for the 2nd–16th time obtaining the same SSR Awakener, each duplicate will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment; starting from the 17th time, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining an Awakener or excess Awakener Shards through selectable methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) as well as random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awakening count is shared, and is counted independently from other Awakening types"
