]]
  },
  Summon_14135_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [Wheels of Rotation] Standard WoD Awakening, the base probability for SSR items is 3.03%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR WoD after maximum 30 Awakenings.\nWhen obtaining an SSR wheel through awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be the current directed wheel. \nIf the last two awakenings resulted in non-directed SSR wheels, the next SSR wheel obtained through awakening will definitely be the current directed wheel. \nCurrently, {s1} consecutive non-directed wheels have been obtained. \nThe following Faded Legacy limited wheels have been added to the [Wheels of Rotation] Standard Awakening, sharing a 0.5% combined appearance probability for SSR wheels during the [Wheels of Rotation] Standard Awakening. These limited wheels cannot be selected in a directed manner and cannot be obtained through the [Book of Rotation].\n○ Wheels: \"Hymn of the Sovereign,\" \"Grace Through Pain,\" \"By Rose Alone,\" \"Treasured Rarity,\" \"Shrouded Birth,\" \"Queen's Edict,\" \"Tablet of Scriptures,\" \"Aberrant Devour,\" \"Merciful Nurturing,\" \"Power of the Pious,\" \"The Last Verse,\" \"Hour of Fortune,\" \"Eternal Requiem,\" \"Drowning in Crimson,\" \"Wheel Unseen\" have been added to the [Wheels of Rotation] Standard Awakening. \n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [Wheels of Rotation] Standard WoD Awakening, the base probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, with a combined probability (including guarantees) of 25.02%. All SR items in this awakening are wheels. \nA maximum of 5 awakenings will guarantee obtaining an SR or higher item through the safety net, with a 96.97% chance of obtaining an SR item and a 3.03% chance of obtaining an SSR item. \n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\nWhen obtaining an SSR wheel through awakening, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; when obtaining an SR wheel, you will receive 5 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; and when obtaining an R wheel, you will receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct. \nThis awakening belongs to the [Standard Wheel Awakening], and the guaranteed awakening count will be accumulated separately, independent of other types of awakening counts. \n"
  },
