  Summon_77951_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guaranteed system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be this period’s rate‑up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Rhan-Tegoth>.\n·If the SSR Awakeners obtained in 2 consecutive Awakens are not the rate‑up character of this period, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the rate‑up character of this period.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non‑rate‑up character {s2} consecutive times.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item within a maximum of 5 Awakens. Through this guaranteed system, the Probability of obtaining an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny via Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by‑product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by‑product.\n·Regardless of the method used (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd to 16th time, each duplicate will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment. Starting from the 17th duplicate and onward, non‑limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment; limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selectable methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) and random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awakening count is shared, and it is tracked independently from other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
