  Summon_77955_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the total Probability (including guarantees) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guarantee system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be this period’s rate-up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Tulu: Godking>.\n·If the SSR Awakeners obtained in 2 consecutive Awaken attempts are not the rate-up character of this period, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the rate-up character of this period.{s1}\n·You have currently obtained non–rate-up characters {s2} times in a row.{s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the total Probability (including guarantees) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·Within a maximum of 5 Awaken attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item. When obtaining SR items through the guarantee system, the Probability is 96.97% for SR items and 3.03% for SSR items.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny via Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by-product.\n·Regardless of the acquisition method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system rewards, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd–16th time, each duplicate will be converted into 1 Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment. Starting from the 17th time, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards obtained through selectable methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) and random methods (including Sepirot Capture:Faded Legacy, etc.) will not be converted into Radix Sediment.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], guaranteed Awakening counts accumulate together and are counted independently from other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
