  Summon_77965_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonPurple:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guarantee) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guarantee system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Awakener <SummonPurple:Shantak>.\n·If the SSR Awakeners obtained in 2 consecutive Awaken attempts are not the featured rate-up character, then the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the featured rate-up character. {s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non-featured character for {s2} consecutive times. {s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonPurple:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guarantee) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny items.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item within a maximum of 5 Awaken attempts. When obtaining an item through the guarantee, the Probability of receiving an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of receiving an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of how it is obtained (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system rewards, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd to 16th time, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment each time; starting from the 17th time, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selection methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], guaranteed Awakening counts accumulate together and are calculated independently from guaranteed counts of other Awakening types.\n\n"
  },
