  Summon_78008_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] The limited-time WoD Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time rate-up Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Rhan-Tegoth Exclusive Weapon>.
: During the event, the Awakening rate for the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Rhan-Tegoth Exclusive Weapon> will be increased.
: In this limited-time Event Awakening, aside from special rules such as rate-up triggers and guarantees, all Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny use the base rates. Please refer to the rules description for details.
: Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time Event Awakening, Keepers can perform one discounted Awakening each day for 60 Silver Prime, and will receive an additional 60 Silver.

<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>
: Due to the unique gameplay mechanics, and to ensure enjoyment and fairness, the game may apply balance adjustments that weaken or strengthen the Effects of Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny.
: When a weakening occurs, the game will open a limited-time rollback feature to provide an opportunity to redeploy resources used for the development or Awakening of Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny.
: Please make sure you understand and accept this before investing resources]]
  },
  Summon_78008_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SSR items is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny via pity within at most 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Wheel of Destiny for this period, <SummonOrange:Rhan-Tegoth Exclusive Weapon>.\n·If the SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained in the previous Awaken was not the boosted Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken will be guaranteed to be the boosted one.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining SR items is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item via pity within at most 5 Awaken attempts. When obtaining an item through pity, the Probability of receiving an SR item is 96.97%, and the Probability of receiving an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment.\n·This Awakening belongs to [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], pity Awaken counts accumulate together and are counted independently from other Awakening types.\n"
  },
