  Summon_78011_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] The limited-time WoD Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time featured Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Nephren-Ka’s Exclusive Weapon>.\n: During the event, the Awakening rate of the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Nephren-Ka’s Exclusive Weapon> will be increased.\n: In this limited-time Event Awakening, aside from boosted rates, guarantees, and other special rules, all Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny use the base probabilities. Please refer to the rule description for details.\n: Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time Event Awakening, Keepers can perform one discounted Awakening each day for 60 Silver Prime and receive an additional 60 Silver.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustments]>\n: Due to the game’s unique mechanics, to ensure fairness and enjoyment, the Effects of Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny may be weakened or strengthened in balance adjustments.\n: When a weakening occurs, a limited-time rollback feature will be enabled to provide an opportunity to redeploy resources invested into Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny.\n: Please be sure to invest resources only after understanding and accepting this"
  },
  Summon_78011_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the total Probability (including the guarantee) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny. You are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny through the guarantee within at most 30 Awaken attempts.\n· When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Nephren-Ka Exclusive Weapon>.\n· If the last obtained SSR Wheel of Destiny from Awaken was not the featured boosted-probability Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken will be guaranteed to be the featured boosted-probability Wheel of Destiny for this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the total Probability (including the guarantee) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awaken are Wheel of Destiny.\n· Within at most 5 Awaken attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n· When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by-product.\n· This Awaken belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awaken count will accumulate together, and it is counted independently from other Awaken types.\n"
