  },
  Summon_78804_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonOrange:Temporary Text>]The limited-time Wheel of Destiny event Awaken has started. During the event, the Keeper can awaken the limited-time event UP Wheel<SummonOrange:Dule Saiyin's special weapon>.\n·During the event, the awakening probability of the limited SSR Wheel<SummonOrange:Dule Saiyin's special weapon> will be increased.\n\n·In this limited-time event, aside from the trigger probability boost, guaranteed drops, and other special rules, all Awakened entities or Wheels will use the base probability, as specified in the rules.\n·Daily recommended awakening: During this limited-time event, the Keeper can awaken once daily with a discount of 60 Silver Prime and will receive an additional 60 Silver. \n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>\n·Due to the unique gameplay, for ensuring game fun and fairness, the game may apply balance adjustments to weaken or enhance the effects in Awakened entities or Wheels.\n·When weakening occurs, the game will enable a time-limited rollback feature to allow for redeployment of resources for the nurturing or awakening of Awakened entities and Wheels.\n·Please make sure to invest resources with this understanding and acceptance in mind.\n\n"
  },
  Summon_78804_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nAt the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny via pity within at most 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Wheel of Destiny for this period, <SummonOrange:Doresain Exclusive Weapon>.\n·If the SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained in the previous Awakening was not the rate-up Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the rate-up Wheel of Destiny for this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nAt the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item via Awakening is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·Within at most 5 Awaken attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item via pity. The Probability of obtaining an SR item via pity is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by-product.\n·This Awakening belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], pity Awaken counts accumulate together, and are tracked independently from pity counts of other Awakening types.\n"
  },
