    Text = "[<SummonOrange:Temporary Text>]The limited-time Wheel event awakening has begun. During the event, Keepers can awaken the limited-time event UP Wheel <SummonOrange:Kepershante's Exclusive Weapon>.\n·During the event, the awakening probability of the limited SSR Wheel <SummonOrange:Kepershante's Exclusive Weapon> will be increased.\n\n·In this limited-time event awakening, all Awakeners or Wheels will use the base probability except for the special rules such as triggering probability increase and guarantee, which are subject to the rules description.\n·Daily recommended awakening: During this limited-time event awakening, Keepers can awaken once daily for a discount of 60 Silver prime, and will additionally receive 60 Silver.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>\n·Due to the unique gameplay of the game, in order to ensure the fun and fairness of the game, adjustments may be made to weaken or enhance the effects of Awakeners and Wheels.\n·When a weakening occurs, the game will activate a limited-time rollback feature to give Awakeners and Wheels the opportunity to redeploy resources.\n·Please make resource investments with the understanding and acceptance of this.\n\n"
  },
  Summon_78805_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nAt [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Wheel of Destiny, and a guaranteed SSR Wheel of Destiny can be obtained within up to 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, there is a 50.00% Probability that it will be this period’s featured SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Corposant Exclusive Weapon>.\n·If the last Awaken attempt yielded an SSR Wheel of Destiny that was not the featured boosted Wheel of Destiny of this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awaken is guaranteed to be the featured boosted Wheel of Destiny of this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nAt [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base Probability of awakening an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·A guaranteed SR or higher item can be obtained within up to 5 Awaken attempts. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through Awaken, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·This Awakening belongs to [WoD Event Awakening]. In any [WoD Event Awakening], guaranteed Awaken attempts are accumulated together and are counted independently from other Awakening types.\n"
  },
