  },
  Summon_78820_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] limited-time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guarantees) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guarantee system within a maximum of 30 Awaken attempts.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener through Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be the featured SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Corposant>.\n·If the SSR Awakener obtained in 2 consecutive Awaken attempts is not the featured rate-up character, the next SSR character obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the featured rate-up character. {s1}\n·You have currently obtained non-featured characters for {s2} consecutive times. {s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guarantees) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny items.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item within a maximum of 5 Awaken attempts. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through Awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.\n·Regardless of the method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), when obtaining the same SSR Awakener for the 2nd–16th time, each duplicate will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment; starting from the 17th time and onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, Awakeners obtained through selectable methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.) as well as overflow Awakener Shards will not be converted into Radix Sediment.\n·This Awakening belongs to the [Character Event Awakening] type. In any [Character Event Awakening], guarantee progress will accumulate jointly, and it is counted independently from other Awakening types.\n\n"
