  Summon_78828_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = "[<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] Limited-Time Wheel of Destiny Event Awakening is now live. During the event, Keepers can awaken the limited-time UP Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Xu's Special Weapon>.\n·During the event, the awakening rate of the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Xu's Special Weapon> will be increased.\n\n·In this limited-time awakening event, all Awakeners or Wheels will use the base probability, except for special rules such as triggered probability increases and guarantees, which will be subject to specific rule explanations.\n·Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time awakening event, Keepers can awaken once daily at a discount of 60 Silver Prime, and will also receive an additional 60 Silver.\n\n<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>\n·Due to the unique gameplay, to ensure fun and fairness, the game may implement balance adjustments that weaken or enhance effects of Awakeners and Wheels.\n·When weakening occurs, the game will enable a limited-time rollback feature to provide Awakeners and Wheels the opportunity to redeploy resources for their development or awakening.\n·Please ensure you understand and accept this before investing resources.\n\n"
  },
  Summon_78828_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] limited-time WoD Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 5.02%. All SSR items obtained are Wheels of Destiny, and within at most 30 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Wheel of Destiny through the pity system.\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, there is a 50.00% probability that it will be the UP SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:Xu Zhuanwu> for this period.\n·If the last SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening was not the rate-up Wheel of Destiny for this period, then the next SSR Wheel of Destiny obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the rate-up Wheel of Destiny for this period.\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonOrange:Suggested Translation>] WoD Event Awakening, the base probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including pity) is 25.00%. All SR items within this Awakening are Wheels of Destiny.\n·Within at most 5 Awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item through the pity system. The probability of obtaining an SR item through pity is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When an SSR Wheel of Destiny is obtained through Awakening, 50 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an SR Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 5 Radix Sediments will also be obtained as a byproduct; when an R Wheel of Destiny is obtained, 1 Radix Sediment will also be obtained as a byproduct.\n·This Awakening is a [WoD Event Awakening]. Across all [WoD Event Awakenings], the pity count is shared and accumulated together, and is tracked independently from the pity counts of other Awakening types.\n"
