  Summon_94429_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Sealed Dawn>] Limited Wheel of Destiny Event Awakening is available!
During the event, the SSR WoD <SummonOrange:"Doomsday Rampage"> enjoys boosted drop rate.
After the event ends, the limited SSR Wheel of Destiny <SummonOrange:"Doomsday Rampage"> will still appear in Limited WoD Awakenings 3-9 months after its first Rate-Up, and will enter [Wheels of Rotation] Standard WoD Awakening approximately one year later.
Except for special rules (e.g., rate boosts, guarantees), all drops use base probabilities. See Rules for details.
Daily Discount: 60 Silver Prime per Awakening (+60 Silver bonus).

<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Because of Morimens' unique gameplay, Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny may be buffed or nerfed via balance adjustments to ensure fun and fairness.
If nerfed, a Limited-Time Reset event allows resource refunds.
Please acknowledge this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_94429_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Sealed Dawn>] Limited WoD Event Awakening, the base probability for SSR items is 3.03%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 5.02%. All SSR items are Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR WoD after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR WoD through Awakening, there is a 50.00% chance it will be the current Rate-Up SSR <SummonOrange:"Doomsday Rampage">.
If the last SSR WoD obtained was not the Rate-Up SSR WoD, the next SSR WoD will be guaranteed to be the Rate-Up SSR WoD.

<Title:[SR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Sealed Dawn>] WoD Event Awakening, the base probability for SR items is 15.85%, with overall probability (including guarantees) of 25.02%. All SR items obtained will be Wheels of Destiny.
Guaranteed SR or higher item every 5 Awakenings, with:
96.97% chance for SR item
3.03% chance to upgrade to SSR item.

<Title:[Special Notes]>
Additional rewards per Awakening:
SSR Wheel of Destiny: 50 Radix Sediments
SR Wheel of Destiny: 5 Radix Sediments
R Wheel of Destiny: 1 Radix Sediment\n
This Awakening belongs to the [WoD Event Awakening]:
Pity count carries over between all [WoD Event Awakening], and maintains separate counter from other Awakening types.

]]
  },
