  Summon_94430_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonBlue: Suggested Translation>] The limited-time Character Event Awakening is now available. During the event, Keepers can Awaken the limited-time rate-up character <SummonBlue: Genesis Ogier>.
: During the event, the Awakening probability of the limited SSR Awakener <SummonBlue: Genesis Ogier> will be increased.
: In this limited-time Event Awakening, except for special rules such as rate-up triggers and guarantees, all Awakeners or Wheel of Destiny items use the base probabilities. Please refer to the rule description for details.
: Daily Recommended Awakening: During this limited-time Event Awakening, Keepers can perform one discounted Awakening per day for 60 Silver Prime, and will receive an additional 60 Silver.

<Title: [Balance Adjustments]>
: Due to the unique gameplay, balance adjustments may be made to strengthen or weaken the Effects of Awakeners or Wheel of Destiny items to ensure fairness and enjoyment.
: When a weakening occurs, a limited-time rollback feature will be enabled to give Awakeners or Wheel of Destiny items a chance to redeploy resources used for development or Awakening.
: Please make resource investments only after fully understanding and accepting this]]
  },
  Summon_94430_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = "<Title:[SSR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Limited-Time Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 5.02%. All obtained SSR items are Awakeners, and you are guaranteed to obtain an SSR Awakener through the guarantee system within at most 30 Awakenings.\n·When obtaining an SSR Awakener via Awakening, there is a 33.33% Probability that it will be this period's rate-up SSR Awakener <SummonBlue:Genesis Ogier>.\n·If you obtain a non-featured SSR Awakener in 2 consecutive Awakenings, then the next SSR obtained through Awakening is guaranteed to be the featured rate-up character of this period. {s1}\n·You have currently obtained a non-featured rate-up character for {s2} consecutive times. {s3}\n\n<Title:[SR Items]>\nIn the [<SummonBlue:Suggested Translation>] Character Event Awakening, the base Probability of obtaining an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall Probability (including guaranteed) is 25.00%. All SR items in this Awakening are Wheel of Destiny.\n·You are guaranteed to obtain an SR item or higher within at most 5 Awakenings. The Probability of obtaining an SR item through the guarantee is 96.97%, and the Probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.\n\n<Title:[Special Notes]>\n·When obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediment as a by-product; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a by-product.\n·Regardless of the method (including but not limited to Awakening, shop exchange, system gifts, etc.), for the 2nd–16th time obtaining the same SSR Awakener, each instance will be converted into 1 corresponding Awakener Shard and 50 Radix Sediment; starting from the 17th time and onward, non-limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment, 3 Gnosis Fragments, and 150 Radix Sediment, while limited SSR Awakeners will be converted into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments, 6 Gnosis Fragments, and 250 Radix Sediment. However, when obtaining Awakeners or excess Awakener Shards through selectable methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, Prototype Horizon, etc.) or random methods (including Sepirot Capture·Faded Legacy, etc.), Radix Sediment will not be converted.\n·This Awakening belongs to [Character Event Awakening]. In any [Character Event Awakening], the guaranteed Awakening count is accumulated together and is counted independently from other Awakening types"
  },
