  Summon_98111_LongDesc1 = {
    Text = [[
[<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections>] Walks of All Life Awakening is available! During the event period, Keepers can awaken all Faded Legacy limited Awakeners and WoDs.
In this Limited-Time Event Awakening, except for special rules such as increased trigger probabilities and guarantees, all Awakeners or Destiny Wheels will use the base probabilities, as specified in the rules explanation.
Recommended Daily Awakening: In this Walks of All Life Awakening, the Keeper can awaken once at a discounted cost of 60 Silver Prime daily and receive an additional 60 Silver Cores.

<Title:[Balance Adjustment]>
Due to the unique gameplay, to ensure enjoyment and fairness in the game, there may be balance adjustments to weaken or enhance the effects in Awakeners and Destiny Wheels.
When a weakening occurs, the game will enable a limited-time rollback feature to allow Awakeners and Destiny Wheels the opportunity to redeploy resources.
Please ensure that you are aware of and accept this before investing resources.

]]
  },
  Summon_98111_LongDesc2 = {
    Text = [[
<Title:[SSR Items]>
In the [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections>] Walks of All Life Awakening, the base probability to obtain an SSR item is 3.03%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 5.02%. SSR items are Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny, with a guaranteed SSR item after maximum 30 Awakenings.
When obtaining an SSR item through awakening, there is a 33.33% chance it will be an SSR Awakener.
If two consecutive awakenings result in an SSR Wheel of Destiny, the next SSR obtained through awakening will definitely be an Awakener.{s1}
You have currently consecutively obtained non-SSR Awakeners for {s2} times.{s3}

<Title:[SR Item]>
In the Character Event Awakening of [<SummonOrange:Kaleido Recollections>], the base probability to obtain an SR item is 15.85%, and the overall probability (including guaranteed odds) is 25.02%. All SR items in this awakening are Wheels of Destiny.
After a maximum of 5 awakenings, you are guaranteed to obtain an SR or higher item through the guaranteed odds. The probability of obtaining an SR item through guaranteed odds is 96.97%, and the probability of obtaining an SSR item is 3.03%.

<Title:[Special Notes]>
When obtaining an SSR Wheel of Destiny through awakening, you will also receive 50 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; when obtaining an SR Wheel of Destiny through awakening, you will also receive 5 Radix Sediments as a byproduct; when obtaining an R Wheel of Destiny, you will also receive 1 Radix Sediment as a byproduct.
Duplicate SSR Awakener conversion:
2nd-16th copies: 1 Awakener Shard + 50 Radix Sediments
17th+ copies: non-limited SSR Awakeners will convert into 1 Refined Gnosis Fragment + 3 Gnosis Fragments + 150 Radix Sediments
limited SSR Awakener will convert into 2 Refined Gnosis Fragments + 6 Gnosis Fragments + 250 Radix Sediments.
Note: No conversion occurs when an Awakener is obtained through Self-Selection methods (including Protoparadise, Rebirth Core, and Prototype Horizon) and Random-drops (such as Sepirot Capture: Faded Legacy).
This awakening belongs to the [Walks of All Life Awakening]. In any [Walks of All Life Awakening], the guaranteed awakening count will be accumulated collectively, and it will be statistically independent from the guaranteed awakening counts of other awakening types.

]]
